      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my little boy is burning up with a fever and he's acting super fussy. he's 18 months old and weighs about 11kg. i have some infant acetaminophen (the 160mg/5mL liquid kind) in the cabinet. how much should i give him right now to get the fever down??",
